factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 6 problems
  The reel_script and slides say the encroachment removal order is for 'கோவை திருச்சி சாலை' / 'திருச்சி சாலை' (Trichy Road), which is consistent with the article, so no issue there; however the reel_script states that the collector ordered removal of roadside encroachments and that the gap in the median must be closed, but the article only says the collector instructed this, which is consistent.
  The reel_script says the encroachment 'அதிகம் உள்ளது' at the end of the flyover, but the article says the shopkeepers encroached the mud path near the sign board; the slides and caption say 'ரோட்டைக் குறுக்கே கடப்பதை' as a required action, which is fine.
  The reel_script omits the key finding that Tamil Nadu has the most road accidents nationally and Coimbatore district has the most in Tamil Nadu, and that accidents fell 31% this year due to government action; these important facts of the article are missing.
  The slides_spec 'என்ன நடந்தது?' slide says 'விபத்துகள் நடப்பதாக சாலை பாதுகாப்பு கமிட்டியில் விவாதம்', which is a mild misstatement: the article says the proposal (extending the sign board to the road end so encroachment stops) was discussed in the committee, not the accidents themselves being debated.
  The caption says 'வாகனங்கள் ரோட்டில் ஒழுங்கின்றி நிறுத்தப்படுகின்றன' while the article says 'குண்டக்க மண்டக்க' (haphazardly) parking by customers; wording is acceptable but the caption omits that customers are the ones parking.
  The reel_script states 'மையத்தடுப்பில் உள்ள கற்களுக்கு இடையே உள்ள இடைவெளியில் பாதசாரிகள் சாலையைக் கடப்பதால் விபத்துகள் நடக்கின்றன' which is accurate, but the reel_script and caption omit that the pedestrians are struck when vehicles come fast from the flyover, a cause mentioned in the article.
